    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Expand around centre / interval DP</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/palindromic-substrings/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 647</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Palindromic Substrings</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Every palindrome has a centre: a letter (odd length) or a gap between two letters (even length). Grow outward from each of the 2n - 1 centres while the two ends match; every successful step is one more palindrome. O(n²) time, O(1) space; the interval DP gives the same count with an n × n table.</p>\n"
  },
